stat11AddSection("stat11-regression-correlation",{"id": "stat11-s199-corr-rank-5", "title": "Example 5.8 (series y, modified Spearman coefficient)", "headingUrdu": "مثال 5.8 (سلسلہ y، ترمیم شدہ سپیئرمین عددی سر)", "headingPashto": "بېلګه 5.8 (لړۍ y، ترمیم شوی د سپیرمن ضریب)", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 199, "printedPage": "189"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["stat11-s199-a1", "stat11-s199-a2", "stat11-s199-a3", "stat11-s199-a4"]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 0}, {"type": "equation", "index": 1}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["stat11-s199-a5"]}], "equations": [{"id": "stat11-s199-r", "latex": "r_s=1-\\dfrac{6\\left(\\sum d^2+T\\right)}{n^3-n}", "accessible": "r_s = 1 − 6(Σd² + T)/(n³ − n)", "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "r_s = 1 − 6(Σd² + T)/(n³ − n)"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "r_s = 1 − 6(Σd² + T)/(n³ − n)"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "r_s = 1 − 6(Σd² + T)/(n³ − n)"}]]}, "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"}, {"id": "stat11-s199-r2", "latex": "=1-\\dfrac{6(42.5+2.5)}{10^3-10}", "accessible": "= 1 − 6(42.5 + 2.5)/(10³ − 10)   [the printed denominator reads \"103 − 10\", i.e. 10³ − 10]", "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "= 1 − 6(42.5 + 2.5)/(10³ − 10)   [the printed denominator reads \"103 − 10\", i.e. 10³ − 10]"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "= 1 − 6(42.5 + 2.5)/(10³ − 10)   [the printed denominator reads \"103 − 10\", i.e. 10³ − 10]"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "= 1 − 6(42.5 + 2.5)/(10³ − 10)   [the printed denominator reads \"103 − 10\", i.e. 10³ − 10]"}]]}, "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"}, {"id": "stat11-s199-r3", "latex": "=1-\\dfrac{6(45)}{990}=1-0.2727=0.73", "accessible": "= 1 − 6(45)/990 = 1 − 0.2727 = 0.73", "nativeLines": {"en": [[{"text": "= 1 − 6(45)/990 = 1 − 0.2727 = 0.73"}]], "ur": [[{"text": "= 1 − 6(45)/990 = 1 − 0.2727 = 0.73"}]], "ps": [[{"text": "= 1 − 6(45)/990 = 1 − 0.2727 = 0.73"}]]}, "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 189. The lower half of the page is blank. In the second line the printed denominator is \"103 − 10\" for 10³ − 10. Header graphics and watermark excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-12T13:23:00.323377+00:00", "scope": "Scan 199 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
stat11Pair("Series y:","سلسلہ y:","لړۍ y:",{"id": "stat11-s199-a1", "role": "solution", "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"}),
stat11Pair("73 is repeated for 2 times, the corresponding rank positions are 6 and 7. Hence rank [73] = (6 + 7)/2 = 6.5 and m is equal to the number of tied observations = 2. Therefore (m³ − m)/12 = (2³ − 2)/12 = (8 − 2)/12 = 6/12 = 0.5","73 دو بار دہرایا گیا ہے، متعلقہ درجے کی پوزیشنیں 6 اور 7 ہیں۔ لہٰذا درجہ [73] = (6 + 7)/2 = 6.5 اور m برابر مشاہدات کی تعداد کے برابر = 2۔ اس لیے (m³ − m)/12 = (2³ − 2)/12 = (8 − 2)/12 = 6/12 = 0.5","73 دوه ځله تکرار شوی، اړونده رتبې ځایونه 6 او 7 دي. نو رتبه [73] = (6 + 7)/2 = 6.5 او m د برابرو کتنو له شمېر سره مساوي = 2. نو (m³ − m)/12 = (2³ − 2)/12 = (8 − 2)/12 = 6/12 = 0.5",{"id": "stat11-s199-a2", "role": "solution", "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"}),
stat11Pair("Now for repeated values 98 and 73, the element (m³ − m)/12 is added i.e. T = 2 + 0.5 = 2.5","اب دہرائی گئی قدروں 98 اور 73 کے لیے عنصر (m³ − m)/12 جمع کیا جاتا ہے یعنی T = 2 + 0.5 = 2.5","اوس د تکرار شویو ارزښتونو 98 او 73 لپاره عنصر (m³ − m)/12 جمع کېږي یعنې T = 2 + 0.5 = 2.5",{"id": "stat11-s199-a3", "role": "solution", "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"}),
stat11Pair("Thus, the modified spearman’s rank correlation coefficient for repeated values is","اس طرح دہرائی گئی قدروں کے لیے ترمیم شدہ سپیئرمین کا درجاتی ارتباطی عددی سر ہے","په دې توګه د تکرار شویو ارزښتونو لپاره ترمیم شوی د سپیرمن رتبه‌یي همتړاو ضریب دی",{"id": "stat11-s199-a4", "role": "solution", "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"}),
stat11Pair("The variables are positively correlated.","متغیرات مثبت طور پر مربوط ہیں۔","متغیرونه په مثبت ډول همتړي دي.",{"id": "stat11-s199-a5", "role": "solution", "exampleId": "stat11-ex-5-8"})
]});
